[{:adr/authoritative_for ["orgs/etzhayyim/root/20-actors/ holds 1,027 <vendor>-compat clean-room API-compat cljc actors (CRUD+pagination+filtering+validation over kotoba Datom log, generated from each vendor's public OpenAPI spec) - these are library-shaped code per ADR-2606302300's kotoba-lang admission rule, not etzhayyim public-interest organism actors, so they relocate to kotoba-lang following the kami-nv-compat precedent (ADR-2607020130)" "2026-07-04 scan finding: source is already ~2,055 .cljc files (no TS to port), but deps.edn is broken/vestigial in both observed shapes - pseudo-format {:dependencies {:kotoba \"workspace\" ...}} (not valid tools.deps) in the majority shape, or stale {:local/root \"../../40-engine/kotoba\"} (target dir no longer exists) in the older shape; actual test execution uses nbb --classpath src:test(s) directly and never touches deps.edn, so the catalog already runs/passes with zero external deps despite the broken manifest" "naming rule: new_name = \"com-\" + kebab(strip-suffix(old_dir, \"-compat\")), ASCII-fold diacritics, underscores->hyphens; com- prefix chosen unconditionally (matches existing com-etzhayyim-*/com-junkawasaki convention) rather than per-vendor-accurate reverse-DNS TLD, which is out of scope for a 1,027-item mechanical pass" "per-repo recipe: copy to scratch -> replace deps.edn with valid self-contained tools.deps -> add README Provenance section -> git init+commit -> gh repo create kotoba-lang/<new> --public --source=. --push -> git clone into orgs/kotoba-lang/<new> -> add to manifest/repos.edn :extra-projects -> gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry -> --check -> nbb test green -> commit manifest to superproject main" "old etzhayyim/root/20-actors/<old>-compat/ directories are NOT deleted by this ADR; deletion is a separate follow-up PR once the full catalog has landed in kotoba-lang and in-tree non-consumption is reconfirmed at scale" "pilot batch (this ADR, 8/1,027 landed): nvidia_isaac-compat->com-nvidia-isaac, nvidia_cosmos-compat->com-nvidia-cosmos, nvidia_drive-compat->com-nvidia-drive, nvidia_nvml-compat->com-nvidia-nvml, adyen-compat->com-adyen, stripe-compat->com-stripe, anthropic-compat->com-anthropic, sentry-compat->com-sentry" "remaining ~1,019 repos: scoped and scheduled here, NOT executed by this ADR; rollout is batched ~25-50 repos/session, alphabetical by old dir name, progress ledger = manifest/repos.edn :extra-projects entries themselves (no separate tracking file)" "open question (undecided): whether kotoba-lang should really grow to ~1,027 repos vs collapsing some into multi-vendor repos - decided to proceed with the established one-repo-per-lib pattern for consistency (ipfs/pqh/kami-nv-compat/etc.), revisit if repo-count overhead becomes a real problem"], :adr/topic "kotoba-lang", :adr/related ["ADR-2606302300 (org taxonomy; kotoba-lang library-placement rule this migration follows)" "ADR-2607020130 (kami-nv-compat relocation precedent; NOTE that facade is a distinct, larger NVIDIA-Omniverse/Isaac-Sim engine-mirror project and does not overlap with the 4 nvidia_*-compat schema-CRUD actors in this catalog)" "ADR-2607012200 (umbrella kotoba-lang TS->CLJC refactor; different, smaller scope - the 8 etzhayyim-sdk facades, not this 1,027-repo catalog)" "ADR-2607022900 (pin-verification rule enforced by gen-west-manifest.cljs --entry)"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607041500-etzhayyim-compat-catalog-to-kotoba-lang", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-04", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/scope "{:anomalies [\"post_quantum-compat: bare methods/*.cljc dir, no README.md/deps.edn/manifest.json/schema/src/test - needs manual handling, not yet migrated\"], :landed 788, :catalog_root \"orgs/etzhayyim/root/20-actors/\", :pilot_repos [\"com-nvidia-isaac\" \"com-nvidia-cosmos\" \"com-nvidia-drive\" \"com-nvidia-nvml\" \"com-adyen\" \"com-stripe\" \"com-anthropic\" \"com-sentry\"], :remaining 238, :pilot_size 8, :catalog_size 1027, :resume_cursor \"next batch starts alphabetically after roblox-compat\", :status \"session-paused-rollout-in-progress\", :batches [{:name \"batch1\", :range \"8th_wall-compat..amadeus_gds-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch2\", :range \"amd_rocm-compat..astm_codes-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch3\", :range \"athenahealth-compat..bentley_projectwise-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch4\", :range \"bentley-compat..boeing_health-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch5\", :range \"boeing_tap-compat..cbot_agri-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch6\", :range \"cdc-compat..climate_fieldview-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch7\", :range \"clio-compat..coupang-compat\", :size 30, :note \"cloudflare-compat -> com-cloudflare-compat (disambiguated from pre-existing unrelated kotoba-lang/com-cloudflare)\"} {:name \"batch8\", :range \"covermymeds-compat..ddbj-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch9\", :range \"deel-compat..drone_deploy-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch10\", :range \"dropbox-compat..emotiv-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch11\", :range \"encompass-compat..fawry-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch12\", :range \"fbi_ucr-compat..fortinet-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch13\", :range \"freebsd-compat..gong-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch14\", :range \"goodrx-compat..heroku-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch15\", :range \"hike_messenger-compat..iea_stats-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch16\", :range \"iea-compat..isara-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch17\", :range \"isic_codes-compat..kingdee-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch18\", :range \"klarna-compat..logikcull-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch19\", :range \"logingov-compat..mavlink_swarm-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch20\", :range \"maxar_technologies-compat..mosip-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch21\", :range \"mpesa-compat..neoncrm-compat\", :size 30} {:name \"batch22\", :range \"netcracker-compat..oceaneering-compat\", :size 30, :note \"4 nvidia_*-compat dirs (isaac/cosmos/drive/nvml) in this range skipped - already regist